OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny intervals and showers on
OL,6,FTuesday. Thicker cloud will bring more
OL,7,Fgeneral rain to Orkney by mid to late
OL,8,Fafternoon. Fresh to strong
OL,9,Fsoutheasterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy and wet evening for
OL,12,FOrkney with some persistent rain
OL,13,Fovernight. Shetland seeing clear
OL,14,Fspells for the early part of the
OL,15,Fevening before clouding over later but
OL,16,Fmostly dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
