OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA wet start for Orkney,
OL,6,Fcloudy but mostly dry for Shetland,
OL,7,Frain perhaps skirting the islands.
OL,8,FRain becoming light and patchy for
OL,9,FOrkney during the day, still quite
OL,10,Fbreezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FShowery with bright spells on
OL,14,FThursday, wet and windy on Friday and
OL,15,Fquite cold again, further unsettled
OL,16,Fshowery conditions into the weekend.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
